/v1/","context":{"app_id":4501960,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4501960-1843481262702656","game_id":"steam-4501960","kind":"announcement","title":"HAIGLA Demo - New Content Coming Soon","summary":"The Demo Is ExpandingSince releasing the HAIGLA demo, I've continued working on the full game and building new areas, events and encounters.After watching players experience the demo, I felt that some sections could better represent the pacing and intensity of what HAIGLA has become.So, I'm bringing some of that new content into the demo.Full Game Content Is Coming to the DemoRather than creating content specifically to extend the demo, I'm taking several events originally developed for the full","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-14T18:19:54Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262702656","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:28:55Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4501960-1841579228678879","game_id":"steam-4501960","kind":"announcement","title":"HAIGLA Demo Releases August 28","summary":"The HAIGLA Demo is ready and will be released on August 28After a lot of development, testing, fixing, and polishing, the demo is finally finished and ready for you to play.The demo includes all of the main gameplay mechanics that will be present in the full game, giving you a proper introduction to HAIGLA, its world, and its unusual way of exploring it.What's includedAll main gameplay mechanicsA substantial section of the game to exploreCollectibles to find and discoverMultiple supported langua","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-25T16:51:15Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228678879","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:28:55Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4501960-1840310314349450","game_id":"steam-4501960","kind":"announcement","title":"HAIGLA Demo Is Nearing Completion","summary":"Hello everyone!It’s time for another HAIGLA development update — and this one is a pretty big milestone.The demo is nearing completionThe HAIGLA demo has now reached its final stage of development.The main content is complete, and most of the remaining work is focused on testing, localization, bug fixing and smaller improvements before release.Rather than creating a very limited preview of the game, I wanted the demo to properly represent what playing HAIGLA will actually be like.Because of that","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-09T15:48:16Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314349450","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:28:55Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4501960-1835871199309947","game_id":"steam-4501960","kind":"update","title":"Development Update – Demo Polish & Final Development Phase","summary":"Development UpdateHello everyone,I wanted to share a quick update on the progress of HAIGLA.Over the past months, development has been moving steadily forward, and the majority of the game's core content is now complete. Most of the planned gameplay sections, environments, systems, puzzles, and encounters are already implemented and playable.My current focus is on polishing the demo experience and continuing work on the final parts of the game. This includes improving atmosphere, refining visual","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-20T19:39:53Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835871199309947","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:28:55Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4501960-1827626365749780","game_id":"steam-4501960","kind":"announcement","title":"HAIGLA is Now Live on Steam","summary":"HAIGLA is now live on SteamI’m excited to finally share HAIGLA - a dark, atmospheric horror experience currently in full development.HAIGLA is built around tension, perception, and uncertainty. You are not just exploring a space, you are constantly questioning it. What you see may help you survive… or lead you deeper into danger.The world reacts in subtle and unsettling ways. Shapes shift. Sounds mislead. Something is always present, even when you can’t fully perceive it. Your awareness becomes ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-18T10:09:25Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1827626365749780","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:28:55Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4501960":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T02:33:36Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T02:33:36Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4501960":"2026-10-26T02:33:36Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4501960":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T02:33:36Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T02:33:36Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"5062280":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T02:33:36Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T02:33:36Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4501960","app_id":4501960,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:39Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"69781a8e93ef17d978caf80a1637fc45aa150de5dfe24c034e44e7a611e96f05",